<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Your PH Healthcare Account</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .box { background: #f0f4ff; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 16px 0; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Welcome to PH Healthcare System, <%= name %></h2>
      <p>An account has been created for you. Use the organization email below to log in. This is not a self-registration, so there is no email OTP.</p>
      <div class="box">
        <p><strong>Login email:</strong> <%= organizationEmail %></p>
        <p><strong>Temporary password:</strong> <%= password %></p>
      </div>
      <p>Change this password immediately after you log in. You will not be able to use the rest of the platform until you do.</p>
      <div class="footer">&copy; PH Healthcare System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
